  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EQUINET&apos;s work aims to shape, inform and support the development &amp; implementation of policy measures and capacities to revitalise, build &amp; consolidate national health systems that are based on principles of universality, comprehensiveness &amp; solidarity, centred on strong state &amp; public sector in health. It consists of a network of SSA &amp; EA institutions coordinated by a SC. Secretariat based at TARSC,Zimbabwe</narrative>
